    "body": "# Context\nWhen clicking in a user tag in a message bubble, it shows the start chat screen. This is a bit unexpected comparing with other chat apps (like whatsapp or signal) where tags navigate to the same screen that you woudl see when clicking on a group member from the members lists screen.The reason for doing this is that tags in messages may tag users that are not in the group. \n\n# Solution\nA solution that we discussed here https://github.com/marmot-protocol/whitenoise/pull/665#discussion_r3261928955 would be to keep the start chat navigation only for users that are not members of the group and for group members navigate to the group member screen\n\n⚠️ We don't want to fetch group members in every chat bubble",
